for longer tokens beginning with them. Recognize their unfinished UTF-8
prefixes too: these can fire before the character is disambiguated. Separately,
NUL bytes after ASCII letters are negative, less so after spaces/punctuation.
Everything else is zero. State resets at document boundaries.
