"""A partial orthographic and formatting predictor.

Away from document starts, predict moderate positives for standalone UTF-8
continuation bytes and line-initial '1', and a weak positive for short ASCII
word pieces ending in k/g/q. Byte responses depend on whether the character
is unfinished, Katakana, Hangul, or another script.
