-culus/-ulu endings, and a document-opening 'Title:'.  Negative cases include
split word-initial long s, incomplete Greek/Tibetan/Hangul encodings, and
Thai vowel-mark sequences.  Repeated middle dots and a small document-start
baseline are also modeled.  Everything else is zero.  State is just a short
byte suffix, the previous token, and position within the current document.
Constants approximate training means; weak context-dependent activity is omitted.
